# Chapter VIII, the visions: from the Void the Hall of Fate shows the player
# the past -- the Witch King's childhood in the Old Forest, the storm on the
# city of Storm and Emperor Goth's camp, the dwarves' war under the Demon
# King, and the burning galleon -- and sets them down in Melee.
# Position stands in for the walks Daras takes no part in and damage for the
# fights; once he follows, the player walks and takes the doors. Ref FormIDs
# carry Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from void_time
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# "It is time": the Void hands the player to the Hall of Fate.
case void_time
until 3000 GetPCCell "Hall of Fate" == 1
end

# The hall's far end opens on the Old Forest.
case fate_forest
run
player->PositionCell 10668 14300 3276 0 "Hall of Fate"
button 0
expect GetJournalIndex A_VIII_DerHexenkonig == 1
end

# Through the forest to the Witch King's birthplace, his letter, and the
# claw wolf that killed his parents.
case witch_birthplace
run
player->Position 6081 458700 2182 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VIII_DerHexenkonig == 2
run
player->Position 6664 462700 1385 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VIII_DerHexenkonig == 3
run
player->Position 20859 462750 65 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VIII_DerHexenkonig == 4
run
player->Position 21496 463700 97 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VIII_DerHexenkonig == 5
activate 054BCF60
take 054BCF60
close Book Menu
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VIII_DerHexenkonig == 6
until 300 "asartans_claw_wolf"->GetDisabled == 0
console 05B7695C.damageav health 100000
button 0
expect GetJournalIndex A_VIII_DerHexenkonig == 7
until 300 GetPCCell "Sorcerer's Tower" == 1
end

# Young Asartan in the old magician's tower, then the storm on Storm.
case witch_tower
until 3000 Addonvar == 1
button 0
button 0
expect GetJournalIndex A_VIII_Storm == 1
end

# Through the burning city.
case storm_city
run
player->Position -36372 455300 2563 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VIII_Storm == 2
run
player->Position -39001 453400 2630 0
until 300 Addonvar == 4
end

# Emperor Goth's camp: a guard asks after Storm, and the Kaiser gives orders.
case goths_camp
run
player->Position -16529 462300 535 0
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
ask escape the evil
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_VIII_GothsLager == 1
run
player->Position -15256 460700 166 0
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
ask situation in the city
choose 1
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_VIII_GothsLager == 2
expect Addonvar == 10
end

# The attackers' mage falls, Wend's force arrives, and the battle turns.
case goths_battle
until 300 "VGothAngreiferMagier01"->GetDisabled == 0
console 05ABE128.damageav health 100000
until 600 Addonvar == 11
expect GetJournalIndex A_VIII_GothsLager == 3
run
player->Position -12581 458000 1881 0
button 0
until 300 GetPCCell "Inner Dwarven Cave" == 1
end

# Deep down, Daras fetches the player for Mert.
case dwarves_daras
run
player->PositionCell 5784 1400 984 0 "Inner Dwarven Cave"
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_VIII_ZwergenKrieg == 1
end

# Mert at the smelter sends everyone to work.
# The landing's pathgrid ends short of the boulder beside it, so the player steps around it onto the
# cave's navmesh; the upper floor is reached through the cave's own pair of Dwemer doors.
case dwarves_mert
# Steered round the boulder by the landing and over the rails: big governor steps push the player into them.
pace 10
steer 5790 1630 968
steer 6091 1630 984
steer 6200 1620 980
# Down the mine along its pathgrid, over the rails: the travel package stalls on this navmesh.
steer 6350 1550 973
steer 6593 1481 921
steer 6848 1429 861
steer 7003 1498 808
steer 6951 1755 733
steer 7003 2218 765
steer 7049 2558 691
steer 7012 2814 632
steer 7113 3220 583
steer 7149 3576 535
steer 7150 3880 535
steer 7136 4148 534
steer 7232 4288 512
steer 7264 4320 512
steer 7296 4352 513
steer 7296 4416 513
steer 7200 4672 512
steer 7168 4704 513
activate 05D29EAF
until 300 player->GetPos y > 5600
# Up the gallery along its pathgrid: the travel package stands still while the gallery's attackers fight on.
steer 7049 6339 676
steer 7052 7017 667
steer 7044 7638 672
steer 7051 8416 668
steer 7051 9109 664
activate 0563B701
until 600 GetPCCell "Dwarven Smelter Cave" == 1
# Along the navmesh: the travel package stands still at the door here.
steer 4061 -1356 11286
steer 4066 -1253 11286
steer 4086 100 11330
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_VIII_ZwergenKrieg == 2
end

# Eight picks from the storeroom.
case dwarves_picks
walk 3063 -576 11357
activate 05605F11
until 600 GetPCCell "Dwarven Storage Cave" == 1
# Up the Dwemer stair corridor to the picks: one walk (the old steer chain stuck at -963 1800).
walk -1000 1750 -700
take 058A1D3E
take 05ED31CF
take 05A11E48
take 052957DF
take 05782C58
take 05263E09
take 05A6A024
take 054579B1
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VIII_ZwergenKrieg == 3
end

# Back through the smelter to the lift down the shaft.
case dwarves_shaft
# Daras follows: the player walks to each door and to the lift.
walk 1966 2454 -1148
activate 055E7346
until 600 GetPCCell "Dwarven Smelter Cave" == 1
walk 4088 8127 11365
activate 054F19F2
until 600 GetPCCell "Dwarven Shaft" == 1
# To the lift operator (VAufzugfuhrerScript boxes within 200 of him).
walk 4448 4170 124029
button 0
until 600 player->GetPos z < 10000
end

# Mao in the canyon of Grul, out of the shaft's foot. Mao's script has Daras
# greet first ("That's Mao there", ending in Goodbye); only once the player
# leaves it does Daras's own script, which returns in menu mode, write journal
# 4 and greet again.
case dwarves_mao
# From the lift's foot up the slope to the canyon door: one walk, so Daras and the others keep up.
walk 3113 3216 13
activate 05D7D816
until 600 GetPCCell "Subterranean Canyon of Grul" == 1
walk 5303 6700 12673
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 30
bye
# Daras greets on the way. He is the second of three followers, which trail the player about 230
# apart, so he stands about 340 behind; the player goes round Mao onto the planks past him to bring
# Daras within the 300 of Mao his script waits for.
walk 5303 6700 12673
steer 5303 6720 12673 walk
steer 5180 6740 12660 walk
steer 5180 6850 12660 walk
steer 5290 6850 12660 walk
steer 5300 6900 12660 walk
until 3000 GetJournalIndex A_VIII_ZwergenKrieg == 4
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
bye
end

# The Demon King in the Arpk temple; the vision moves to the Emperor's galleon.
# Daras stays above ("go on down"). The temple's only door opens from a Daedric hall 2000 below the
# canyon ledge: down the mine rails past Mao, west through the boulder cave, down the Daedric stair to
# the hall and its door; then north through the temple until the king, within 800, sends the vision.
case dwarves_demon_king
pace 10
# A dwarf captain greets on the way down; a greeting ends a walk, so each walk is followed by closing it.
walk 5300 6900 12660
bye if open
walk 4825 8037 12350
bye if open
walk 2880 7744 12114
bye if open
walk 2845 7276 12127
bye if open
walk 2736 6786 12265
bye if open
walk 2712 6480 12245
bye if open
walk 2752 5568 11908
bye if open
walk 2944 5250 11760
bye if open
walk 2816 4736 11489
bye if open
walk 2816 4224 11221
bye if open
walk 2752 1024 11221
bye if open
walk 2690 900 11221
bye if open
activate 05B1D225
until 600 GetPCCell "Arpk Temple" == 1
# The dwarf king greets on the way in; a greeting ends a walk, so each walk is retried after it.
walk -441 653 -1329
bye if open
walk -441 653 -1329
bye if open
walk -177 1447 -1324
bye if open
walk -177 1447 -1324
bye if open
walk -121 2451 -1357
bye if open
walk -121 2451 -1357
bye if open
walk -100 2800 -1357
bye if open
button 0
until 300 GetPCCell "Emperor's Galleon, Crew's Quarters" == 1
end

# On deck, the messenger of the Order carries the child away.
case galleon_end
run
player->PositionCell 146 1500 -907 0 "Emperor's Galleon, Deck"
button 0
until 300 GetPCCell "Melee Monastery" == 1
end
